WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:07.476
IDTC Grid is the referral reward plan for the IDTC presale on TPIX Chain.

2
00:00:07.896 --> 00:00:16.128
Share your link. When friends buy through it, you receive IDTC, from a budget that was set aside before the sale began.

3
00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:21.492
Here is exactly how it works. Every number, and every rule.

4
00:00:22.292 --> 00:00:30.596
Rewards come from a fixed budget of fifteen billion IDTC, taken from the project's operations and marketing allocation.

5
00:00:31.016 --> 00:00:45.416
They are never paid from buyers' money. One hundred percent of the presale USDT goes into the IDTC USDT liquidity pool, and that liquidity is locked until February twenty-ninth, twenty twenty-eight.

6
00:00:45.836 --> 00:00:50.516
And the plan cannot be changed in any way that would exceed that budget.

7
00:00:51.316 --> 00:01:00.484
Joining is free. Connect your wallet, and sign one message to prove it's yours. No password, no fee, and no gas.

8
00:01:00.904 --> 00:01:03.664
You get your own invite link right away.

9
00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:08.472
Rewards are counted in three rings, from the buyer upward.

10
00:01:08.892 --> 00:01:15.132
Friends you invite directly are ring one. You receive five percent of the IDTC they buy.

11
00:01:15.552 --> 00:01:22.320
Their friends are ring two, at three percent. One level further is ring three, at one percent.

12
00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:31.476
During the launch, ring one earns more. Plus two percent in sale weeks one to three, and plus one percent in weeks four to six.

13
00:01:31.896 --> 00:01:36.432
And the friend who bought through your link receives an extra one percent, too.

14
00:01:37.232 --> 00:01:47.552
Let's make it concrete. A friend buys one hundred USDT of IDTC in the presale. That is about sixty-six point seven million IDTC.

15
00:01:47.972 --> 00:01:59.276
As their direct inviter, you receive five percent, about three point three million IDTC. In the first three weeks, it's seven percent, about four point seven million.

16
00:01:59.696 --> 00:02:06.728
Your friend also gets about six hundred and sixty-seven thousand IDTC extra, for coming through your link.

17
00:02:07.148 --> 00:02:12.764
These are token amounts, not cash. What they are worth depends on the market price of IDTC.

18
00:02:13.564 --> 00:02:16.636
Ranks unlock the rings, step by step.

19
00:02:17.056 --> 00:02:22.240
Buy at least ten USDT yourself, and you are a Spark. That unlocks ring one.

20
00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.028
Two direct friends who bought make you a Cell, unlocking ring two.

21
00:02:27.448 --> 00:02:36.280
Four direct friends, and one thousand USDT of team volume, make you a Grid. That unlocks ring three, and the weekly Sprint.

22
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:44.620
Ten direct friends, and ten thousand USDT of team volume, make you a Core, with a double share of the Sprint.

23
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:55.188
Every week, a Sprint pool of two percent of the IDTC sold that week is shared among Grid and Core members, by their team volume that week.

24
00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:59.088
No one can take more than twenty percent of a single pool.

25
00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:02.072
A few simple rules keep it fair.

26
00:03:02.492 --> 00:03:12.812
A purchase only counts after the buyer has held the tokens for fourteen days. Anything sold or moved out early earns nothing, and that share goes back to the budget.

27
00:03:13.232 --> 00:03:17.648
This is checked from on-chain transfers, not from anyone's word.

28
00:03:18.068 --> 00:03:29.516
Empty rings don't pass upward. You can bind an inviter only once, before your first purchase. And rates are fixed by the week you buy. A plan change never applies backwards.

29
00:03:30.316 --> 00:03:40.588
Payouts happen on-chain. The team publishes payout rounds to a reward contract on TPIX Chain, and you claim them straight to your own wallet, with zero gas.

30
00:03:41.008 --> 00:03:50.224
Half of each round can be claimed at once. The other half unlocks after the presale closes, on March first, twenty twenty-seven.

31
00:03:50.644 --> 00:03:56.188
The website never holds your keys. Every claim is signed by you, in your own wallet.

32
00:03:57.088 --> 00:04:09.544
Please read this part carefully. Rewards are IDTC tokens, not an investment return. IDTC can lose value, even all of it. Nothing here is a promise of profit.

33
00:04:09.964 --> 00:04:15.340
Only use money you can afford to lose, and never promise profits to the people you invite.

34
00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:23.316
IDTC Grid. A fixed budget, clear rules, paid on-chain. Learn more at idtc dot online.
